            "heading": "Embroidery & Printed Artwork",
            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "underline_heading": false,
            "text": "<p>Most Vescartes pieces feature dense embroidery or specialist print techniques.<br/>These elements are integral to the garment and should be treated with care.</p><p>Avoid aggressive washing, heat, or friction</p><p>Always turn garments inside out before cleaning</p><p>Never scrub directly over embroidery or printed areas</p><p>Do not iron directly onto artwork</p><p>When in doubt, professional dry cleaning is recommended.</p>",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "heading_size_desktop": 32,
            "heading_size_mobile": 24,
            "text_size_desktop": 16,
