            "heading": "Denim (Jeans & Denim Jackets)",
            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "underline_heading": false,
            "text": "<p>Recommended care:</p><p>Wash infrequently</p><p>Cold machine wash (30°C max), inside out</p><p>Mild detergent only</p><p>Do not bleach</p><p>Do not tumble dry</p><p>Air dry flat or hung</p><p>For embroidered denim, avoid spin-heavy cycles.<br/>Spot clean where possible to extend lifespan.</p>",
            "text_alignment": "center",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "heading_size_desktop": 32,
